WEBVTT

00:00:00.255 --> 00:00:02.300
The board asks one question.

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:04.420
Are we carrying more risk than we agreed to?

00:00:04.515 --> 00:00:06.700
If the answer lives in disconnected
policies,

00:00:06.835 --> 00:00:09.740
dashboards, and decisions, it is hard to
defend.

00:00:10.235 --> 00:00:12.060
Put your risk appetite on the record.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:14.680
Appetite.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.165
Declare how much risk leadership will carry,
area by area.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:22.465
AiVRIC Enterprise Vision calculates the
overall appetite from those tolerances.

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:24.887
Tolerance.

00:00:25.312 --> 00:00:27.617
Compare the line you set with measured
posture,

00:00:27.732 --> 00:00:29.857
averse on paper, exceeded in practice.

00:00:30.412 --> 00:00:32.357
Now you can see where action is needed.

00:00:33.517 --> 00:00:34.257
Policy.

00:00:34.277 --> 00:00:36.442
Generate standards from the controls you
run.

00:00:36.677 --> 00:00:39.762
Cross-walked to SOC 2, ISO, and GDPR.

00:00:39.797 --> 00:00:41.902
Review, approve, publish.

00:00:42.157 --> 00:00:43.602
Preserve the version you issued.

00:00:45.222 --> 00:00:46.022
Decision.

00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:48.187
Weigh every treatment against your
tolerance.

00:00:48.302 --> 00:00:50.067
Go above it and record why.

00:00:50.142 --> 00:00:51.747
Your name, your justification.

00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:53.127
An accountable decision.

00:00:54.907 --> 00:00:55.782
Metric.

00:00:56.007 --> 00:00:58.252
Give the board numbers it can hold the
program to.

00:00:58.307 --> 00:01:01.512
Record the reading, the target, and the
evidence behind it.

00:01:04.182 --> 00:01:04.762
Roadmap.

00:01:04.782 --> 00:01:06.622
Turn priorities into a sequenced plan.

00:01:06.642 --> 00:01:10.002
Clear owners, dependencies, and phases
across 90 days.

00:01:10.022 --> 00:01:11.227
Know what comes next.

00:01:13.647 --> 00:01:14.147
Board.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.227
Freeze the report.

00:01:15.247 --> 00:01:18.587
One branded snapshot of posture, findings,
and the remediation plan.

00:01:18.607 --> 00:01:20.972
A consistent basis for every quarterly
review.

00:01:23.547 --> 00:01:24.422
Your program.

00:01:24.507 --> 00:01:25.382
Your decisions.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.312
Your risk appetite on the record.

00:01:28.957 --> 00:01:30.162
AiVRIC Enterprise Vision.

00:01:30.237 --> 00:01:30.937
See it.

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:31.637
Score it.

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:32.257
Prove it.

00:01:32.277 --> 00:01:33.152
Book a walkthrough.
